# Legacy of the Lost: the requirement arm. The mission has no status area, so the check reads the nation log. Bastok
# status 1: the entry door shows no menu (a message and a release); then Bastok status 0: the entry door shows the
# menu 32000.
lists TalaccaCove/_1l0/onTrigger TalaccaCove/onEventUpdate/32000 TalaccaCove/onEventFinish/32000 TalaccaCove/onEventFinish/32001 TalaccaCove/onEventFinish/32002 TalaccaCove/_1l1/onTrigger
char zone=TalaccaCove pos=-88.879,-7.318,-109.233 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau LegacyOfTheLost current
login
missionstatus Bastok 1
trigger _1l0
missionstatus Bastok 0
trigger _1l0
